# Python documentation-regression test bytecode.
__pycache__/

# Local scratch scripts and dead-end probes live at the root and are never part of the product.
# `format:check` is the first gate in `npm run verify`, so one stray file fails CI in under a
# minute with an error that has nothing to do with the app; ignoring them keeps that gate honest.
/*.mjs
!/scripts/**/*.mjs
